### Open the interactive GraphQL playground in your browser:
###   http://localhost:3000/graphql

### Query: list all recipes
POST http://localhost:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "{ recipes { id title description } }"
}

### Query: get one recipe by id
POST http://localhost:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "{ recipe(id: 1) { title description } }"
}

### Mutation: add a new recipe
POST http://localhost:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation { addRecipe(input: { title: \"Omelette\", description: \"Quick egg dish\" }) { id title } }"
}
